Runtime: SDD

Purpose:
  Agent runtime temporary workspace. This is NOT part of the
  source project. It contains temporary files, caches, locks,
  and run artifacts.

Owns: ./

Structure:
  runs/:
    Agent run artifacts
  cache/:
    Context cache
  temp/:
    Temporary files
  locks/:
    Resource locks

Rules:
  [RT1]  Runtime files are temporary and MUST be cleaned up.
  [RT2]  Runtime is NOT part of source control.
  [RT3]  Sensitive data in runtime MUST be encrypted.
  [RT4]  Runtime MUST be isolated per project.

State: +
  